Package: anki
Version: @VERSION@
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Anki Packaging Team <anki@localhost>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libgl1,
  libnss3, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0,
  libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1,
  libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0,
  libxrandr2, libxrender1, libxtst6, libglib2.0-0 | libglib2.0-0t64
Recommends: mpv, lame
Suggests: mplayer
Description: An intelligent spaced-repetition memory training program
 Anki is a program which makes remembering things easy. Because it's a lot
 more efficient than traditional study methods, you can either greatly
 decrease your time spent studying, or greatly increase the amount you learn.
 .
 Anyone who needs to remember things in their daily life can benefit from
 Anki. Since it is content-agnostic and supports images, audio, videos and
 scientific markup (via LaTeX), the possibilities are endless.
 .
 This package bundles its own Python 3.13 runtime and all required
 Python dependencies including PyQt6.
